ung</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Suter</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Szneke</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Risk of pneumonia and other complications of influenza-like illness in patients treated with oseltamivir.</article-title><source>Curr Med Res Opin</source><volume>21</volume><fpage>761</fpage><lpage>768</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15969875</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006051-Enger1"><label>19</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Enger</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Nordstrom</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Thakrar</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Sacks</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Rothman</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Health outcomes among patients receiving oseltamivir.</article-title><source>Pharmacoepidemiol Drug Saf</source><volume>13</volume><fpage>227</fpage><lpage>237</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15255089</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006051-Lee1"><label>20</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>PK</given-names></name><name><surname>Choi</surname><given-names>KW</given-names></name><name><surname>Lui</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Wong</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Factors associated with early hospital discharge of adult influenza patients.</article-title><source>Antivir Ther</source><volume>12</volume><fpage>501</fpage><lpage>508</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17668558</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006051-McGeer1"><label>21</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McGeer</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Green</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Plevneshi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Shigayeva</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Siddiqi</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Antiviral therapy and outcomes of influenza requiring hospitalization in Ontario, Canada.</article-title><source>Clin Infect Dis</source><volume>45</volume><fpage>1568</fpage><lpage>1575</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18190317</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006051-Katz1"><label>22</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Katz</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Tharmaphornpilas</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Chantra</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Dowell</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name><name><surname>Uyeki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Who gets hospitalized for influenza pneumonia in Thailand? Implications for vaccine policy.</article-title><source>Vaccine</source><volume>25</volume><fpage>3827</fpage><lpage>3833</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17367898</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006051-Simmerman2"><label>23</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simmerman</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Chittaganpitch</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Erdman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sawatwong</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Uyeki</surn